<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ June qtr PPI inputs, outputs both fall 0.2 pct.</title>
<headline>NZ June qtr PPI inputs, outputs both fall 0.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday released the following data on the Producers Price Index for the June quarter: (percentage change)</p>
<p>		June 1996 qtr	 March 1996 qtr   June 1995 qtr</p>
<p>Inputs index   -0.2		  +0.4		 +0.2</p>
<p>Outputs index  -0.2		  +0.3		 +0.4</p>
<p>		 Yr-end Jun 1996   Yr-end Mar 1996   Yr-end Jun 1995</p>
<p>Inputs index     +0.5		+0.9		    +0.7</p>
<p>Outputs index    +0.4		+1.0		    +1.4</p>
<p>The PPI measures the average level of industrial input prices (excluding labour) and output prices.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
